5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who we actually talk to once the desks are moved.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The current layout feels arbitrary. I want to know who gets the worse spots.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am concerned about the budget line. It has not changed in years.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,My schedule is tight. I need to know how much time this takes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Comfort is invisible on paper. I need to check the physical setup.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, if we sit closer, does that help or hurt your gaps?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, what specifically makes a spot ""worse"" to you?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I think the cost of the space itself is the real issue.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, I just want to avoid long setup times every morning.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, sound and chair fit. Things you only notice after hours.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the arrival times to see who is here first.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the drawn plan against the staff survey.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look into the basis of the department's floor billing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the sound meter readings across the room.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,And I will check what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,And I will look at the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,And I will check the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,And I will check the arrival times in the badge records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,And I will look at the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
