35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The joiners learned by overhearing. Proximity matters more than we think.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The survey says daylight is the biggest complaint. The plan ignores it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We are paying for empty desks. 41,000 yen a month for nothing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,The pilot floor took up to nine minutes to set up. That’s huge.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The printer side is nine decibels louder. My chair takes days to adjust.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, nine minutes is a lot. Can we avoid that?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, if we pay for area, maybe we need fewer desks?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, or we need to justify why we need the space we have.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, I agree. I hate losing my morning gaps to setup.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, if the sound is bad, we can’t just assign those seats randomly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I think rotating blocks might help with the morning chaos.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"But the facilities quote is 6,200 yen per desk for every change.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,That’s expensive. Fixed desks might be cheaper in the long run.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,Fixed desks mean I’m stuck with a bad spot if I get one.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"But if we fix them by function, maybe we can group people who talk.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I’m leaning towards rotating blocks to avoid the setup time.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I’m concerned about the cost of frequent changes.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I need to see the final numbers before I agree.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,I want to ensure the window seats are distributed fairly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I need a guarantee of comfort.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
